[JPL-OS::SYSTEM_BOOTSTRAP_v0.1]

PURPOSE:
JPL-OS is a deterministic graph IR operating system for:
- cross-model translation (GPT / Gemini / Claude)
- structural diffing of semantic graphs
- entropy + compression benchmarking
- versioned ontology evolution (JPL Codec)

PRIMARY PRINCIPLES:
- no natural-language dependency inside kernel
- all meaning = graph primitives
- all outputs = diff-computable structures
- all state = externalized (Supabase)
- all execution = traceable (GitHub + MCP logs)

